  "tables": [],
  "limitations": [
    "The correlational analyses between brain measures and behavioral indicators did not survive conservative multiple comparison correction, requiring cautious interpretation and future verification.",
    "The study design lacked pre-intervention resting-state brain data, preventing a direct assessment of whether nature experience is beneficial or urbanicity is detrimental in terms of brain activity changes over time.",
    "Further research is needed to systematically study soundscapes with multiple levels of sound entropy and relate them to BOLD entropy in specific brain networks.",
    "The study does not fully unravel the specific active ingredients of auditory stimuli driving the observed brain changes (e.g., sound pattern features vs. belief-based construction by the listener)."
  ],
